## Device plugin integration with the Topology Manager

The Topology Manager is a Kubelet component that allows resources to be co-ordinated in a Topology
aligned manner. In order to do this, the Device Plugin API was extended to include a TopologyInfo struct.

message TopologyInfo {
    repeated NUMANode nodes = 1;
}

message NUMANode {
    int64 ID = 1;
}

